{"title":"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The 2007 AMC 12 contests will be scored by awarding 6 points for each correct response, 0 points for each incorrect response, and 1.5 points for each problem left unanswered. After looking over the 25 problems, Sarah has decided to attempt the first 22 and leave the last 3 unanswered. How many of the first 22 problems must she solve correctly in order to score at least 100 points? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/c/10cf7cf53da60582284bc725adebe4c24a028317.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm {(A)}\\ 13 \\qquad \\mathrm {(B)}\\ 14 \\qquad \\mathrm {(C)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\mathrm {(D)}\\ 16 \\qquad \\mathrm {(E)} 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"384\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>She must get at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/1/8216ea67ea6f73802a985f9bffdfef682ab59998.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100 - 4.5 = 95.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"128\" height=\"13\" /> points, and that can only be possible by answering at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/1/e016f9edfefb0fbd7f3610ee393381b6c5314646.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lceil \\frac{95.5}{6}\\rceil = 16 \\Rightarrow \\mathrm {(D)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"149\" height=\"37\" /> questions correctly.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B\">2007 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Probl